# CORS — required when the frontend is not on localhost (e.g. ngrok to Vite)
# Exact origins (comma-separated):
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173,https://factual-anchovy-on.ngrok-free.app
# Optional regex (defaults include *.ngrok-free.app, *.ngrok.io, *.ngrok.app). Clear to disable:
# CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN_REGEX=
